<p>Increases all unarmed damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">29%, 42%, 51%, 59%, 66%</acronym> and physical power by 30 (including grapples and kicks).</p><p>Note that brawlers naturally gain 0.5 Physical Power per character level while unarmed (current brawler physical power bonus: <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>character level 1, 10, 25, 40, 50">0.5, 5.0, 13, 20, 25</acronym>) and attack 20% faster while unarmed.</p>